endpoints, and (away from the two hybrid-boundary layers) the same is true of
the `V` coordinate.  This reduces the finite receipt from every carrier to

* the aggregate carrier itself; and
* `r = 1` or `r = R - 1`, with
  `v ∈ {0, 1, 2, V - 2, V - 1, V}`.

